    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Caretaker of a Tiny Egg Living on Your Desktop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing idle nurturing game where you simply watch it grow!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play is Simple:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give your egg a name, and then just watch over it.</strong><br><strong>But simply waiting isn't enough for your egg to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You need to carefully nurture it by managing its temperature and stress levels.</strong><br><strong>As time passes, cracks will begin to form on the egg...</strong><br><strong>And eventually, a Slime Monster called &quot;Slimeon&quot; will be born.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise various Slimeon and complete your collection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/0b7971dc4700f41ec34ef7358a7a94fb.poster.avif?t=1744721417\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/0b7971dc4700f41ec34ef7358a7a94fb.webm?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/0b7971dc4700f41ec34ef7358a7a94fb.mp4?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Completely Idle Nurturing Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The key to this game is patience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even when you're not actively playing\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>whether you're working, studying, or playing other games\u2014</strong><br><strong>As long as the game is running, your egg will slowly and automatically grow.</strong><br><strong>Experience the joy of watching life take shape, even while you're away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, you must be careful.</strong><br><strong>If you neglect temperature control or stress management,</strong><br><strong>Your Slimeon might fail to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To successfully raise your Slimeon, a bit of attention and care is essential.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: This game is not a clicker game.</strong><br><strong>It\u2019s all about gently watching over your egg as it grows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/88cf3ba5294dcbf9429b6e0b48451574.poster.avif?t=1744721417\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/88cf3ba5294dcbf9429b6e0b48451574.webm?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/88cf3ba5294dcbf9429b6e0b48451574.mp4?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Caretaker of a Tiny Egg Living on Your Desktop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relaxing idle nurturing game where you simply watch it grow!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play is Simple:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give your egg a name, and then just watch over it.</strong><br><strong>But simply waiting isn't enough for your egg to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You need to carefully nurture it by managing its temperature and stress levels.</strong><br><strong>As time passes, cracks will begin to form on the egg...</strong><br><strong>And eventually, a Slime Monster called &quot;Slimeon&quot; will be born.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise various Slimeon and complete your collection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/0b7971dc4700f41ec34ef7358a7a94fb.poster.avif?t=1744721417\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/0b7971dc4700f41ec34ef7358a7a94fb.webm?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/0b7971dc4700f41ec34ef7358a7a94fb.mp4?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Completely Idle Nurturing Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The key to this game is patience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even when you're not actively playing\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>whether you're working, studying, or playing other games\u2014</strong><br><strong>As long as the game is running, your egg will slowly and automatically grow.</strong><br><strong>Experience the joy of watching life take shape, even while you're away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, you must be careful.</strong><br><strong>If you neglect temperature control or stress management,</strong><br><strong>Your Slimeon might fail to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>To successfully raise your Slimeon, a bit of attention and care is essential.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note: This game is not a clicker game.</strong><br><strong>It\u2019s all about gently watching over your egg as it grows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/88cf3ba5294dcbf9429b6e0b48451574.poster.avif?t=1744721417\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/88cf3ba5294dcbf9429b6e0b48451574.webm?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/88cf3ba5294dcbf9429b6e0b48451574.mp4?t=1744721417\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
